  "instructions": [
    "Whisk the low-sodium soy sauce, rice vinegar, water, garlic, ginger, and sesame oil in a small bowl.",
    "Heat the extra-virgin olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the tofu and cook for 5 to 7 minutes, stirring occasionally, until golden brown on most sides.",
    "Stir in the broccoli and frozen edamame, and cook for 3 to 4 minutes until the broccoli turns bright green and the edamame thaws.",
